{"uid":"226ae251e17234ea","name":"Desktop customer changes the tester quantity at its boundaries","fullName":"features/tester_purchase.feature:Desktop customer changes the tester quantity at its boundaries","time":{"start":1792997553920,"stop":1792997557460,"duration":3540},"description":"To try a paint colour at home before buying a full tin\nAs a Dulux customer\nI want to add a tester for a chosen shade to my basket\n\nBoundary values for the basket quantity (TC-04a). The field declares a minimum of 1, so 0 is\nrefused client-side and the field settles back on the last accepted quantity. A small typed\nquantity is accepted by the server. The upper limit is deliberately not probed here: it is\nthe shade's live stock level, which changes (see the stubbed out-of-stock scenario below).\nThe basket is seeded through the site's own add-to-cart API, so each example loads only the\nbasket page.","descriptionHtml":"<p>To try a paint colour at home before buying a full tin<br />\nAs a Dulux customer<br />\nI want to add a tester for a chosen shade to my basket</p>\n<p>Boundary values for the basket quantity (TC-04a). The field declares a minimum of 1, so 0 is<br />\nrefused client-side and the field settles back on the last accepted quantity. A small typed<br />\nquantity is accepted by the server. The upper limit is deliberately not probed here: it is<br />\nthe shade's live stock level, which changes (see the stubbed out-of-stock scenario below).<br />\nThe basket is seeded through the site's own add-to-cart API, so each example loads only the<br />\nbasket page.</p>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[],"testStage":{"description":"To try a paint colour at home before buying a full tin\nAs a Dulux customer\nI want to add a tester for a chosen shade to my basket\n\nBoundary values for the basket quantity (TC-04a). The field declares a minimum of 1, so 0 is\nref